---
source: crates/kuayle/tests/golden.rs
expression: stdout
---
CLI for the kuayle self-hosted issue tracker

Usage: kuayle [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  auth           
  whoami         
  workspaces     
  issues         
  comments       
  relations      
  labels         
  teams          Team actions: list teams, read a single team. 团队操作：列出团队、读取单个团队。
  statuses       Statuses actions: list statuses for a team. 状态操作：列出团队的状态。
  projects       Project actions: list projects, read a single project. 项目操作：列出项目、读取单个项目。
  cycles         Cycle actions: list, read, burndown, velocity (read-only). 周期操作：list、read、burndown、velocity（只读）。
  templates      Template actions: full CRUD for issue templates. 模板操作：issue 模板的完整 CRUD。
  views          View actions: list views, read a single view (read-only). 视图操作：列出视图、读取单个视图（只读）。
  members        Member actions: list workspace members (read-only). 成员操作：列出工作区成员（只读）。
  favorites      Favorite actions: list workspace favorites (read-only). 收藏操作：列出工作区收藏（只读）。
  notifications  Notification actions: list user notifications (read-only, user-scoped). 通知操作：列出用户通知（只读，用户范围）。
  assets         Asset actions: read asset info, upload file (upload is a placeholder). 附件操作：读取附件信息、上传文件（上传为占位）。
  usage          Show command reference / 显示命令参考
  completion     Generate shell completion script / 生成 shell 补全脚本
  self-update    Check for updates or update the binary / 检查更新或更新二进制
  help           Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>      [env: KUAYLE_PROFILE=]
      --url <URL>              [env: KUAYLE_URL=]
      --workspace <WORKSPACE>  [env: KUAYLE_WORKSPACE=]
      --format <FORMAT>        [default: auto]
      --no-cache               Disable resolve disk cache / 禁用解析磁盘缓存 [env: KUAYLE_NO_CACHE=]
  -h, --help                   Print help
  -V, --version                Print version
